PolicydWeight - ChangeLog
=========================

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Version 1.4.0
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

    Ported to Debian 13 (Trixie): policyd-weight 0.1.15.2-13 (systemd unit), Postfix 3.10, Perl 5.40, PHP 7.3
    Requires i-MSCP >= 1.5.4 (plugin API 1.5.1)
    Added: `dnsbl_score' and `rhsbl_score' parameters -- DNSBL/RHSBL lists are now managed by the plugin
    Changed: The plugin manages a block in /etc/policyd-weight.conf ($BIND_ADDRESS, $TCP_PORT, @dnsbl_score,
             @rhsbl_score), which overrides the policyd-weight defaults. The file is no longer generated through a
             shell redirection of `policyd-weight defaults'
    Changed: Default DNSBL list: removed ix.dnsbl.manitu.net (NiX Spam, shut down in January 2025, answers now lead to
             false positives); added psbl.surriel.com
    Fixed: policyd_weight_host/policyd_weight_port were not written in the policyd-weight configuration (daemon
           always listened on 127.0.0.1:12525)
    Fixed: Restriction of previous configuration not removed on configuration change
    Fixed: Wrong service name ('ClamAV') used for delayed service restart on i-MSCP reconfiguration
    Fixed: Parameters are validated (values end in a configuration file evaluated as Perl code)
    Removed: Obsolete SysVinit PID pattern workaround
    Note: Debian 13 is the last Debian release providing policyd-weight; consider migrating to postscreen(8)

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Version 1.3.0
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

    Enhancement: Make it possible to configure PolicydWeight server host through plugin configuration file

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Version 1.2.0
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

    Enhancement: Automatically install distribution packages
    Fixed: Delay restart of policyd-weight policy server on i-MSCP upgrade/reconfiguration
    Fixed: Stop and disable policyd-weight policy server on plugin deactivation
    Removed: Support for i-MSCP 1.3.x Serie

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Version 1.1.0
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

    Fixed: policyd-weight sysvinit script under some distributions doesn't provides status command
    Fixed: Remove space from PolicydWeight service name
    Updated for i-MSCP 1.3.x Serie

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Version 1.0.0
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

    First release
